<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg 728-day muni yields 35.00 pct.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg 728-day muni yields 35.00 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ST PETERSBURG, Russia 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The annualised average yield on an issue of 728-day GGKO municipal bonds was 35.00 percent at an auction on Wednesday, general agent AVK said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction follow:</p>
<p>    Series number			   SU36003GSPMO</p>
<p>    Volume				    100.00 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Denominations			   100,000 rbls</p>
<p>    Bids (nominal)			  100.92 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Sold					 60.94 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Proceeds				   35.88 bln rbls</p>
<p>    Average price			    58.89 pct</p>
<p>    Lowest accepted price		  58.85 pct</p>
<p>    Average yield			    35.00 pct</p>
<p>    Highest accepted yield		 35.06 pct</p>
<p>    Tenor					728 days</p>
<p>    Maturity date			    May 26, 1999</p>
<p>--St Petersburg Newsroom, +7812 219 92 09</p>
